="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1元/立方米*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年的</span>3、9月份最后1个交易日之前应当进行标准仓单注销</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">胶合板</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.035元/张*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">胶合板标准仓单参与交割配对的，相应标准仓单在交收日闭市后且当日内、交易所将卖方交割的标准仓单过户给对应的配对买方后立即注销，但因交割违约或者不符合交割配对条件等原因未完成过户的除外，未参与交割配对的，相应标准仓单在每个交割月份最后</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1个交易日之前应当进行标准仓单注销。</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">鸡蛋</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">6元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">交割配对成功的，相应标准仓单在交收日闭市后且当日内、交易所将卖方交割的标准仓单过户给对应的配对买方后立即注销。未参与滚动交割或者申报交割但不符合交割配对条件的，相应标准仓单应当在仓单注册日后第</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1个交易日闭市后且当日内予以注销。</span></span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><br/></span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">在最后交易日前一交易日闭市后注册的标准仓单，卖方可以使用其参与一次性交割，所有标准仓单在最后交割日闭市后且当日内予以注销。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:48px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">粳米</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">每个交割月份最后交割日前（含当日）应当进行标准仓单注销</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:45px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">苯乙烯</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1.6元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">每个交割月份最后交割日前（含当日）应当进行标准仓单注销</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">液化石油气</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年的</span>3、9月份最后1个交易日之前（含当日）应当进行标准仓单注销</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">生猪</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">5元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">参与交割配对的，相应标准仓单在交收日闭市后且当日内、交易所将卖方交割的标准仓单过户给对应的配对买方后立即注销，但因生猪疫情原因未完成过户的除外</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">；</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">未参与交割配对的，相应标准仓单在每个交割月份最后交割日前（含当日）应当进行标准仓单注销</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">原木</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.6元/立方米*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">原木标准仓单参与交割配对的，相应标准仓单在交收日闭市后且当日内、交易所将卖方交割的标准仓单过户给对应的配对买方后立即注销</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">；</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">未参与交割配对的，相应标准仓单在每年的</span>3、7、11月份最后交割日前（含当日）应当进行标准仓单注销</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">纯苯</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style="text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">元</span>/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">纯苯标准仓单在每个交割月份最后交割日前（含当日）应当进行标准仓单注销。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:80px"><td width="724" valign="center" colspan="3" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:24px">郑州商品交易所</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="height:27px"><td width="68" valign="center" rowspan="2" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">品种</span></strong></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" rowspan="2" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">仓储费</span></strong></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" rowspan="2" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">仓单有效期</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="height:27px"></tr><tr style="height:57px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">强麦</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.5元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">车板交割，无仓单交割</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">棉花</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">新疆地区</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">：</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">0.60元/吨*天</span></p><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">非新疆地区</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">：</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">0.80元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">N年生产的棉花注册的标准仓单，有效期至N+1年11月份的第15个交易日（含该日）</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">普麦</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.4</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">元</span>/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">普麦期货标准仓单有效期为每年</span><span style="font-family:宋体">9月的最后一个工作日</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">白糖</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.5元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">N制糖年度（是指每年10月1日至次年9月30日）生产的白糖所注册的标准仓单，有效期为该制糖年度（是指每年10月1日至次年9月30日）结束后当年11月份的最后一个工作日（含该日）</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">PTA</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.50元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>9月第15个交易日之前（含该日）注册的PTA期货标准仓单，应当在当年9月第15个交易日之前（含该日）全部注销</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">菜籽</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.5元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">N年6月1日起接受菜籽期货标准仓单注册申请，标准仓单有效期至N年11月最后一个工作日（含该日）</span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><br/></span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2701合约之后）每年3月、9月第15个交易日之前（含该日）注册的菜籽期货标准仓单，应当在当年3月、9月第15个交易日之前（含该日）全部注销</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">菜油</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.90元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">N年6月1日起注册的菜油期货标准仓单，有效期至N+1年5月最后一个工作日（含该日）</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">菜粕</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.5元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>3月、7月、11月第15个交易日之前（含该日）注册的菜粕期货标准仓单，应当在当年3月、7月、11月第15个交易日之前（含该日）全部注销</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">早籼稻</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.50元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">N年8月1日起注册的早籼稻期货标准仓单，有效期至N+1年</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">7</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">月份最后一个工作日（含该日）</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">晚籼稻</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>10月1日-下一年度4月30日</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11px">：</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11px">0.5元/吨*天(含保险费等);</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11px"><br/></span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>5月1日-9月30日：</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11px"><br/></span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11px">0.55元/吨*天(含保险费等)</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">N年10月1日起注册的晚籼稻期货标准仓单，有效期至N+1年9月份的最后一个工作日（含该日）</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">粳稻</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>10月1日-下一年度4月30日0.5元/吨*天(含保险费等);</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11px"><br/></span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>5月1日-9月30日：</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11px"><br/></span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11px">0.55元/吨*天(含保险费等)</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">N年10月1日起注册的粳稻期货标准仓单，有效期至N+1年9月份的最后一个工作日（含该日）</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:6px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">甲醇</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">2元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>5月、11月第15个交易日之前（含该日）注册的甲醇完税标准仓单，应当在当年5月、11月第15个交易日之前（含该日）全部注销</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">；</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">保税标准仓单的有效期在完税标准仓单有效期的基础上顺延</span>5个交易日</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">硅铁</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.45元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>2月、6月、10月第15个交易日之前（含该日）注册的硅铁期货标准仓单，应当在当年2月、6月、10月第15个交易日之前（含该日）全部注销</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">锰硅</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: 