="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>2月、6月、10月第15个交易日之前（含该日）注册的尿素期货标准仓单，应在当年2月、6月、10月第15个交易日之前（含该日）全部注销</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">对二甲苯</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">3元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>1月、3月、5月、7月、9月和11月第15个交易日之前（含该日）注册的对二甲苯期货标准仓单，应当在当年1月、3月、5月、7月、9月和11月第15个交易日之前（含该日）全部注销</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">烧碱</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">32%液碱与50%液碱</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><br/></span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">均为</span>2.5元/吨·天（湿吨）</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>1月、3月、5月、7月、9月、11月第15个交易日之前（含该日）注册的烧碱标准仓单，应当在当年1月、3月、5月、7月、9月、11月的第15个交易日之前（含该日）全部注销</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">短纤</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1.2元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span><span style="font-family:宋体">3月、6月、9月、12月第15个交易日之前（含该日）注册的短纤期货标准仓单，应当在当年3月、6月、9月、12月的第15个交易日之前（含该日）全部注销</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">纯碱</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.5/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>1月、3月、5月、7月、9月、11月第15个交易日之前（含该日）注册的纯碱期货标准仓单，应当在当年1月、3月、5月、7月、9月、11月的第15个交易日之前（含该日）全部注销</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">瓶片</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.8/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>1月、5月、9月第15个交易日之前(含该日)注册的瓶片期货标准仓单，应当在当年1月、5月、9月第15个交易日之前(含该日)全部注销</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">丙烯</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">仓库仓单：</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">5</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">元</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">/</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">吨</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">*</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">天</span></p><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">厂库仓单：</span><span style="font-family:宋体">4元</span></span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">/</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">吨</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">*</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1月、3月、5月、7月、9月、11月第15个交易日之前（含该日）注册的丙烯期货标准仓单，应当在当年1月、3月、5月、7月、9月、11月的第15个交易日之前（含该日）全部注销。</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:80px"><td width="724" valign="center" colspan="3" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:24px">广州期货交易所</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="height:53px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">品种</span></strong></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">仓储费</span></strong></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">仓单有效期</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="height:76px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">工业硅</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">元</span>/</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">吨</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span><span style="font-family:宋体">11月最后一个交易日之前（含当日）注册的工业硅期货标准仓单，应在当日之前（含当日）全部注销。注销后，未出库的且生产（出厂）日期在90天以内（含当日）的可以重新申请注册，无需进行质量检验。</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:118px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">碳酸锂</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">5元/</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">吨</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span><span style="font-family:宋体">3月、7月、11月最后一个交易日之前（含当日）注册的碳酸锂期货标准仓单，应当在当年3月、7月、11月的最后一个交易日之前（含当日）全部注销。注销后，未出库且生产日期在60天以内（含当日）的基准交割品和240天以内的替代交割品可以重新申请注册，无需进行质量检验。</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">多晶硅</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">4</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> <span style="font-family:宋体">元</span>/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>5月、11月最后一个交易日闭市后，交易所对多晶硅期货仓库标准仓单和厂库标准仓单进行统一注销，但是生产日期在90日以内（含当日）的多晶硅期货仓库标准仓单除外。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:75px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px; border-style: none solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">钯</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px medium medium; border-style: none solid none none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">1.8 元/千克*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span><span style="font-family:宋体">8月最后一个交易日闭市后，交易所对钯期货厂库标准仓单进行统一注销</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">；</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">仓库标准仓单</span><span style="font-family:宋体">:长期有效</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:75px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: 1px 1px medium; border-style: solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">铂</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">1.8 元/千克*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span><span style="font-family:宋体">8月最后一个交易日闭市后，交易所对铂期货厂库标准仓单进行统一注销</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">；</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">仓库标准仓单</span><span style="font-family:宋体">:长期有效</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:80px"><td width="724" valign="center" colspan="3" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:24px">上海期货交易所</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="height:80px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">品种</span></strong></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">仓储费</span></strong></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">仓单有效期</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="height:86px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">铜</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">完税</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">：</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">0.3元/吨*天</span></p><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">保税库房</span>0.</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">5</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">元</span>/吨*天</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px"><br/></span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">保税货场</span>0.</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">4</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">元</span>/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">长期</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">铝</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">完税</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">:</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px">0.4元/吨*天</span></p><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">保税库房</span>0.6元/吨*天</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px"><br/></span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">保税货场</span>0.5元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">长期</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:57px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">锌</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.3元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">长期</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">铅</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.7元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">长期</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">镍</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1.25元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">长期</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">锡</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1.50元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">长期</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:6px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">氧化铝</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">厂库</span>0.25元/吨/天</span></p><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">仓库室内</span>0.4元/吨/天</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px"><br/></span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">仓库室外</span>0.3元/吨/天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1、氧化铝仓库标准仓单的有效期为该批次产品最早生产日期起180天以内，并且该批次产品应在生产日期起的60天内进入交割仓库方可制成标准仓单；</span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">2、氧化铝厂库标准仓单的交割有效期为厂库标准仓单生成之日起180日。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">黄金</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1.8元/千克*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">长期</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">白银</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.016元/千克*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">长期</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">螺纹钢</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.15元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1、</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">螺纹钢</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">仓库仓单每批商品的有效期限为生产日起的</span><span style="font-family:宋体">90天内，并且应在生产日起的45天内入交割仓库方可制作仓库标准仓单；</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">2、</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">螺纹钢</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">厂库标准仓单的交割有效期为厂库标准仓单生成之日起</span><span style="font-family:宋体">180日。</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">线材</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.15元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1、</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">线材</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">仓库仓单交割线材的每批商品的有效期限为生产日起的</span><span style="font-family:宋体">90天内，并且应在生产日起的30天内入交割仓库方可制作标准仓单；</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">2、</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">线材厂库标准仓单的交割有效期为厂库标准仓单生成之日起</span><span style="font-family:宋体">180日。</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">热轧卷板</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.15元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1、热轧卷板仓库仓单的每批商品的有效期限为生产日起的360天内，每一仓库标准仓单的热轧卷板以其中最早的生产日期作为该标准仓单的生产日期；</span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">2、热轧卷板厂库标准仓单的交割有效期为厂库标准仓单生成之日起180日。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:56px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">天然橡胶</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1.3元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1、国产天然橡胶（SCR WF）在库交割的有效期限为生产年份的第二年的最后一个交割月份，超过期限的转作现货。当年生产的国产天然橡胶如要用于实物交割，最迟应当在第二年的六月份以前（不含六月）入库完毕，超过期限不得用于交割。</span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">2、进口3号烟胶片在库交割的有效期限为进口货物报关单申报日期起十八个月，超过期限的转作现货。用于实物交割的3号烟胶片应当在进口货物报关单申报日期起六个月内进库，否则不得用于交割。</span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">3、在库天然橡胶的质检证（或检测/鉴定报告）自签发之日起90天内有效。期满后，其相应的商品应当重新检验合格后方可用于下次交割。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">丁二烯橡胶</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">仓库</span>0.14元/吨*天</span></p><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">厂库</span>0.13元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1、丁二烯橡胶仓库标准仓单的有效期为生产年份的第二年的6月30日，超过期限的转作现货并注销。用于实物交割的丁二烯橡胶，最迟应当在生产日期起六个月内入库完毕，超过期限不得用于交割。</span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">2、厂库标准仓单的交割有效期为厂库标准仓单生成年份的第二年的6月30日。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">纸浆</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.8元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1、用于实物交割的国产漂针浆有效期限为生产年份的第二年的最后一个交割月份，超过期限的转作现货并注销。</span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">2、用于实物交割的进口漂针浆应当在到港日起六个月内入库，有效期限为到港日的第二年的最后一个交割月份，超过期限的转作现货并注销。</span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">3、厂库标准仓单的交割有效期为厂库标准仓单生成之日起一年零六个月。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">石油沥青</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">仓库</span>1.5/吨*天</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><br/></span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">厂库</span>1.2元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>9月15日（遇法定假日顺延）之前生成的厂库标准仓单，应在10月的最后一个工作日（含该日）之前全部注销</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">;仓库仓单长期有效。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">燃料油</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1.4元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">燃料油保税标准仓单有效期限为保税标准仓单生效年份的第二年的最后一个交割月份，超过期限的转作现货</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">铸造铝合金</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">元</span>/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">铸造铝合金仓库每一标准仓单的有效期为该批次产品最早生产日期起</span><span style="font-family:宋体">360天以内，并且该批次产品应在最早生产日期起180天内进入交割仓库方可制成标准仓单。</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:75px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">不锈钢</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.8元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1、</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">不锈钢仓库标准仓单有效期限为该批次产品最早生产日起的</span><span style="font-family:宋体">360天内。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">2、</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">厂库标准仓单的有效期为厂库标准仓单生成之日起的150</span><span style="font-family:宋体">天内。</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:199px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px; border-style: none solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">胶版印刷纸</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style="text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">仓库：</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">元</span>/吨*天</span></p><p style="text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">厂库：</span><span style="font-family:宋体">0.9</span></span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">元</span>/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1、用于实物交割的国产双胶纸：应当在生产日期起三个月内入库，生产日期在6月30日（含该日）之前的，标准仓单有效期为当年的12月31日；生产日期在7月1日（含该日）之后的，标准仓单有效期为第二年的6月30日，超过期限的转作现货并注销；</span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">2、用于实物交割的进口双胶纸：应当在到港日期起三个月内入库，到港日期在6月30日（含该日）之前的，标准仓单有效期为当年的12月31日；到港日期在7月1日（含该日）之后的，标准仓单有效期为第二年的6月30日，超过期限的转作现货并注销；</span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">3、厂库标准仓单的交割有效期为厂库标准仓单生成之日起12个月，厂库标准仓单超过交割有效期不得用于期货交割。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:80px"><td width="724" valign="center" colspan="3" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:24px">上海国际能源交易中心</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="height:80px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">品种</span></strong></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">仓储费</span></strong></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">仓单有效期</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="height:53px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">原油</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">0.2元/桶*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">长期</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:53px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">国际铜</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:宋体">库房费</span>0.5元/吨·天(境内)</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:12px"><br/></span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:宋体">货场费</span>0.4元/吨·天(境内)</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">长期</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:6px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">20号胶</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1.5元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1、组成每一标准仓单的20号胶标准品或替代品的生产日期应当不超过连续30天。每一标准仓单20号胶标准品或替代品的最早生产日期为该标准仓单的生产日期。20号胶标准品或替代品保税标准仓单的有效期为自标识的生产月份起十二个月止。20号胶境外标准仓单的有效期为签发之日起六个月止，首次交割后立即注销。</span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">2、用于实物交割的20号胶标准品或替代品应当在生产日期起90天内入库，超过90天入库的，不得用于生成保税标准仓单。</span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">3、入库生成保税标准仓单时的20号胶标准品或替代品的检验报告自签发之日起180天内有效，在库商品的检验报告自签发之日起90天内有效。期满后，其相应的商品应当重新检验，合格后方可用于交割。对在库20号胶标准品或替代品重新检验时，质量检验报告不合格的，保税标准仓单持有人对其商品质量承担全部责任，指定交割仓库有责任的除外。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:151px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">低硫燃料油</span></p></td><td width="168" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1.4元/吨*天</span></p></td><td width="487" valign="center" style="padding: 5px 10px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor;"><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1、</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>11月1日（遇国家法定节假日、休息日顺延）之前生成的低硫燃料油保税标准仓单，其有效期限为生成之日起至当年12月31日，超过期限的转作现货</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">；</span></p><p><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">2、</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每年</span>11月1日（含当日，遇国家法定节假日、休息日顺延）之后生成的低硫燃料油保税标准仓单，其有效期限为生成之日起至下一年度12月31日，超过期限的转作现货</span><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">。</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p><span style="text-wrap-mode: wrap;">【免责申明】:本表格内容整理自各交易所，如各交易所规则更新，请以交易所通知公告内容为准。</span></p>
                </div>

